[0m19:41:18.554230 [debug] [Thread-5 (]: On model.gn_dw_silver.FACT_MEMBER_DEV_ACHIEVEMENT: /* {"app": "dbt", "dbt_version": "1.9.4", "profile_name": "default", "target_name": "dev", "node_id": "model.gn_dw_silver.FACT_MEMBER_DEV_ACHIEVEMENT"} */
